## Integration acceptance

- Link every pass you report to an executed result for its stated revision and method. A new example needs its own build and browser checks.
- For each release, run every row of the matrix or mark it Not tested, and keep unresolved failures listed.
- In an accessibility statement for users, keep the documentation, the maintained fixture controls, native tasks and physical device results apart. See [Publish](../content/publish-update-retire/publish.html) for how to describe the evidence and its limits.
